cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "DerivationLab: machine-assisted physics derivations with hash-chained, replayable records"
abstract: >-
  A system that runs physics derivations with language-model Writer, Checker
  and Judge roles under human direction, and records every step, check, model
  call, judgement and human action in an append-only, hash-chained event log.
  It includes a standard-library-only verifier that replays such a record and
  refuses any record whose chain or cross-event semantics do not hold, and a
  renderer that turns a verified record into a self-contained offline HTML view.
authors:
